{"id":"0ae7f6f5eeeb49c1","group":"57","path":"57/57-thm-naf-cwa.md","title":"NAF CWA","display":"thm-naf-cwa — NAF CWA","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-thm-naf-cwa","aliases":["57-thm-naf-cwa"],"display":"thm-naf-cwa — NAF CWA","depends_on":["[[57-df-closed-world-assumption]]","[[57-df-negation-as-failure]]","[[57-df-herbrand-base]]","[[57-thm-sld-soundness]]","[[57-thm-sld-completeness]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-thm-naf-cwa"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-thm-naf-cwa</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-naf-cwa — NAF CWA"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"336b1fe36586a678\" href=\"?note=336b1fe36586a678\" title=\"57-df-closed-world-assumption\">57-df-closed-world-assumption</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f7fdeadb93806ad7\" href=\"?note=f7fdeadb93806ad7\" title=\"57-df-negation-as-failure\">57-df-negation-as-failure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ac4f07708b58159c\" href=\"?note=ac4f07708b58159c\" title=\"57-df-herbrand-base\">57-df-herbrand-base</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e64933cc4ccfc533\" href=\"?note=e64933cc4ccfc533\" title=\"57-thm-sld-soundness\">57-thm-sld-soundness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d2f6edd30be06d05\" href=\"?note=d2f6edd30be06d05\" title=\"57-thm-sld-completeness\">57-thm-sld-completeness</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\mathrm{DefProg}\">\\(P\\in\\mathrm{DefProg}\\)</span>，其所有矩阵原子均为关系应用而非内建等号；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HU}(S)\\neq\\emptyset\">\\(\\mathrm{HU}(S)\\neq\\emptyset\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in B_S\">\\(A\\in B_S\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ac4f07708b58159c\" href=\"?note=ac4f07708b58159c\" title=\"57-df-herbrand-base\">57-df-herbrand-base</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NAF}\">\\(\\mathrm{NAF}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CWA}\">\\(\\mathrm{CWA}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M_{\\mathrm{CWA},P}\">\\(\\mathfrak M_{\\mathrm{CWA},P}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"f7fdeadb93806ad7\" href=\"?note=f7fdeadb93806ad7\" title=\"57-df-negation-as-failure\">57-df-negation-as-failure</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"336b1fe36586a678\" href=\"?note=336b1fe36586a678\" title=\"57-df-closed-world-assumption\">57-df-closed-world-assumption</a>；使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"e64933cc4ccfc533\" href=\"?note=e64933cc4ccfc533\" title=\"57-thm-sld-soundness\">57-thm-sld-soundness</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"d2f6edd30be06d05\" href=\"?note=d2f6edd30be06d05\" title=\"57-thm-sld-completeness\">57-thm-sld-completeness</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NAF}(P,A)\\leftrightarrow A\\notin\\mathrm{CWA}(P).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{NAF}(P,A)\\leftrightarrow A\\notin\\mathrm{CWA}(P).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NAF}(P,A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak M_{\\mathrm{CWA},P}\\models\\neg A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{NAF}(P,A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak M_{\\mathrm{CWA},P}\\models\\neg A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对基原子，成功反驳与逻辑后承等价；取否定得到第一式，再用已定义闭世界结构得到第二式。原断言单独写对象公式 not A，没有给出它在哪个语义中成立。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-closed-world-assumption","status":"resolved","id":"336b1fe36586a678","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-closed-world-assumption]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-negation-as-failure","status":"resolved","id":"f7fdeadb93806ad7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-negation-as-failure]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-herbrand-base","status":"resolved","id":"ac4f07708b58159c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-herbrand-base]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-thm-sld-soundness","status":"resolved","id":"e64933cc4ccfc533","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-thm-sld-soundness]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-thm-sld-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"d2f6edd30be06d05","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-thm-sld-completeness]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-herbrand-base","status":"resolved","id":"ac4f07708b58159c","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $P\\in\\mathrm{DefProg}$，其所有矩阵原子均为关系应用而非内建等号；$\\mathrm{HU}(S)\\neq\\emptyset$，$A\\in B_S$，见 [[57-df-herbrand-base]]。$\\mathrm{NAF}$、$\\mathrm{CWA}$ 和 $\\mathfrak M_{\\mathrm{CWA},P}$ 见 [[57-df-negation-as-failure]]、[[57-df-closed-world-assumption]]；使用 [[57-thm-sld-soundness]]、[[57-thm-sld-completeness]]。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-negation-as-failure","status":"resolved","id":"f7fdeadb93806ad7","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypo